"value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=3779730","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3745860-1833968530890095","game_id":"steam-3745860","kind":"announcement","title":"Space Revolver is Featured in Cerebral Puzzle Showcase 2026","summary":"Hello, this is the Space Revolver team.Space Revolver is being featured in Cerebral Puzzle Showcase 2026.The showcase runs from May 28 to June 4, Pacific Time, and introduces a variety of games for players who enjoy puzzle-focused experiences.Through this showcase, we are glad to share the Space Revolver demo with more players.If you have not tried it yet, you can play the free demo from the Steam store page.The demo includes puzzles built around map rotation and gravity switching, as well as th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-29T04:34:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530890095","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3745860-1833968530884662","game_id":"steam-3745860","kind":"update","title":"Level Editor and Gameplay Flow Improvement Patch","summary":"Greetings from Space Revolver.Several improvements have been applied to the demo build.This patch focuses on improving the puzzle retry flow, reorganizing the Level Editor structure, and polishing some art and sound presentation elements.\\Improved Death Loop FlowPreviously, dying during a level would restart the entire stage from the beginning.With this patch, death now triggers an Undo system instead of Restart.You can now return closer to the point where the mistake happened,making the gamepla","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-27T07:36:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530884662","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3745860-1833334318578670","game_id":"steam-3745860","kind":"announcement","title":"We Showcased Space Revolver at PlayX4 2026","summary":"Hello, this is the Space Revolver team.Space Revolver participated in PlayX4 2026.Thank you to everyone who visited our booth, played the demo, and shared your thoughts with us during the event.PlayX4 was a valuable opportunity for us to introduce Space Revolver in person and observe how players understood and solved the puzzles up close.Demo Play at the BoothAt our booth, visitors were able to try the demo version of Space Revolver that is currently available on Steam.Many players experienced t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-26T07:05:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833334318578670","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3745860-1828894815556476","game_id":"steam-3745860","kind":"update","title":"👉 Level Editor Update – Create and Share Your Own Maps","summary":"Greetings from Space Revolver.Since releasing the demo, we've been carefully reviewing your feedback and figuring out where to take the game next.In this update, we've added a Level Editor feature so you can experience Space Revolver’s puzzles in a new way.\\1. A Level Editor that lets you create maps directly in-game2. A feature to share your created maps via code3. A feature to load and play maps made by other players\\You can enter the map creation screen through the Level Editor menu on the ma","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-02T05:22:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1828894815556476","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3745860-1823825466498984","game_id":"steam-3745860","kind":"announcement","title":"👉 Space Revolver Demo Now Available—We’re Looking for Your Feedback","summary":"Greetings from Space Revolver.We are a small development team made up of college students who love games.After many trials and errors, we’re excited to finally release a demo version of Space Revolver on Steam.This demo is not meant to be a fully polished trial version.Rather, it’s a build created to show what we believe defines a Space Revolver–style puzzle at this point in development.What’s included in this Demo- The core puzzle structure of Space Revolver, built around map rotation and gravi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-06T09:20:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1823825466498984","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3745860-1822556746156045","game_id":"steam-3745860","kind":"announcement","title":"📣 Taipei Game Show 2026 Participation Announcement","summary":"Hi, everyone! We're excited to announce that Space Revolver will be participating in Taipei Game Show 2026! At the venue, you'll be able to play a demo build and get a first look at content currently under development.Event: Taipei Game Show 2026 Dates: Jan. 29 - Feb. 1Booth Location: Space Revolver(S64)If you are planning to visit Taipei Game Show, be sure to stop by our booth to try the game for yourself and share your thoughts with us. Your feedback plays a huge role in shaping the game.And o","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-01-21T07:02:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1822556746156045","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3745860-1815580768284378","game_id":"steam-3745860","kind":"announcement","title":"🎉 SPACE REVOLVER Award Announcement 🎉","summary":"🎉 SPACE REVOLVER Award Announcement 🎉Hello everyone, this is MKstudio, the developer of SPACE REVOLVER.We are excited to share two great pieces of news with you today!✅ 1. Com2uS Global Game Challenge — Selected as TOP 6Among 195 submissions from around the world, SPACE REVOLVER was selected as one of the TOP 6 in the Com2uS Global Game Challenge.This award officially recognizes the game’s quality and potential.✅ 2. Chungnam Global Game Center Indie Game Park — Grand Prize (₩30,000,000)SPACE REV","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-11-07T05:41:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1815580768284378","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3745860-1806698490772908","game_id":"steam-3745860","kind":"announcement","title":"Space Revolver Selected for BIC Exhibition!","summary":"🎉 Hello, everyone! We are MKstudio, the team behind Space Revolver.We’re thrilled to announce that our game has been selected as a Rookie Showcase title at the upcoming Busan Indie Connect Festival (BIC) this August! 🚀 We’re excited to finally share this news with all of you.BIC Event Information📍 Venue: BEXCO, Busan 🕹 Online Exhibition: August 8 – August 29 (Play the games with an online ticket from the comfort of your home) 🎮 Offline Exhibition: August 15 – August 17 (Visit our booth in person","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-08-03T07:56:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1806698490772908","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:56Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3745860":{"last_attemp